		<preface>
			<container name="headerOfAnnex">
				<block name="num">ANNEX III</block>
				<block name="heading">MANAGEMENT AREAS FOR SANDEEL IN ICES DIVISIONS 2a, 3a AND ICES
					SUBAREA 4</block>
			</container>
		</preface>
		<mainBody>
			<paragraph>
				<content>
					<p>For the purposes of the management of the fishing opportunities of sandeel in
						ICES divisions 2a, 3a and ICES subarea 4 fixed in Annex IA, the management
						areas within which specific catch limits apply are defined as shown below
						and in the Appendix to this Annex:</p>
				</content>
			</paragraph>
